  "details": "Using latest client (1937) and latest SDK (3.10.6), a newly added component, VRCVelocityTracker, is always null, no matter how it's accessed or not.\n\nBoth on Udon Graph and UdonSharp.\n\nEditor environment works good, but it's missing in the client. GetComponent<VRCVelocityTracker> also returns null, so it's possible that the client's VRCVelocityTracker and SDK's one does not match.",
